    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2439" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱμᾰτ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make bloody, stain with blood</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱμάτου θεᾶς βωμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					260
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ παρῇδος ὄνυχα . . αἱματοῦτε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					77
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδὲν αἱματώμεθα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1656
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρᾶτας αἱματούμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1149
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾑματωμένη χεῖρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					1135
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				476
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.84
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.4.10
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>slay</i>, aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱματῶσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					987
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>turn into blood</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τροφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					8.379
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Ren.Ves.</u>
				5.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(2).692
			</span></i>.</div>
